{"qid": "btx-01", "category": "bitext", "lang": "en", "expected": "answer", "question": "How do I cancel my order?", "answer": "Pour annuler votre commande :  \n1. Connectez‑vous à votre compte ShopFès.  \n2. Accédez à la section « Order History ».  \n3. Trouvez la commande concernée et cliquez dessus.  \n4. Sélectionnez l’option d’annulation (souvent intitulée « Order History » ou « Cancel order ») et confirmez.  \nEn cas de problème, contactez le support du lundi au samedi de 9h à 18h au +212 5 35 00 00 00 ou via le chat en direct sur www.shopfes.example. [1]", "refused": false, "error": null, "search_query": "How do I cancel my order?", "top_score": 0.7769414186477661, "sources": [{"ref": 1, "chunk_id": "bitext-cancel_order-0#0", "source": "bitext", "title": "cancel order", "version": null, "score": 0.7769}, {"ref": 2, "chunk_id": "bitext-cancel_order-1#0", "source": "bitext", "title": "cancel order", "version": null, "score": 0.754}, {"ref": 3, "chunk_id": "bitext-cancel_order-2#0", "source": "bitext", "title": "cancel order", "version": null, "score": 0.7484}, {"ref": 4, "chunk_id": "bitext-cancel_order-3#0", "source": "bitext", "title": "cancel order", "version": null, "score": 0.7157}], "latency_ms": {"translation": 207.0, "retrieval": 14.2, "generation": 15567.6, "retry_wait": 14000.0, "service": 1788.9, "total": 15788.9}, "prompt_tokens": 1581, "completion_tokens": 180, "checks": {"error": false, "behavior": true, "forbidden": true, "facts": true, "citation": true, "citation_valid": true, "source": true}, "judge": {"faithful": true, "score": 5, "unsupported_claims": [], "parse_error": false, "judge_tokens": 1334}}
{"qid": "btx-02", "category": "bitext", "lang": "fr", "expected": "answer", "question": "J'ai oublié mon mot de passe, que dois-je faire ?", "answer": "Pour réinitialiser votre mot de passe, suivez ces étapes :  \n1. Rendez‑vous sur la page de connexion de la plateforme.  \n2. Cliquez sur « Forgot Password ».  \n3. Entrez l’adresse e‑mail associée à votre compte.  \n4. Un lien de réinitialisation vous sera envoyé (vérifiez votre boîte spam si nécessaire).  \n5. Cliquez sur ce lien et créez un nouveau mot de passe. [1]", "refused": false, "error": null, "search_query": "I forgot my password, what should I do?", "top_score": 0.6690027713775635, "sources": [{"ref": 1, "chunk_id": "bitext-recover_password-1#0", "source": "bitext", "title": "recover password", "version": null, "score": 0.669}, {"ref": 2, "chunk_id": "bitext-recover_password-4#0", "source": "bitext", "title": "recover password", "version": null, "score": 0.4437}, {"ref": 3, "chunk_id": "bitext-recover_password-2#0", "source": "bitext", "title": "recover password", "version": null, "score": 0.4376}, {"ref": 4, "chunk_id": "bitext-recover_password-0#0", "source": "bitext", "title": "recover password", "version": null, "score": 0.4286}], "latency_ms": {"translation": 2639.5, "retrieval": 22.8, "generation": 15068.2, "retry_wait": 14000.0, "service": 3730.6, "total": 17730.6}, "prompt_tokens": 1607, "completion_tokens": 145, "checks": {"error": false, "behavior": true, "forbidden": true, "facts": true, "citation": true, "citation_valid": true, "source": true}, "judge": {"faithful": true, "score": 5, "unsupported_claims": [], "parse_error": false, "judge_tokens": 1318}}
